Subject: [PATCH] Point the gate workflow at AI-Business-Solutions (move step
 8)

The plan calls the gate repo getai/factory-gates. The real organisation on
getai.ghe.com is AI-Business-Solutions. Set GATE_REPO, the six App token
owner fields, the holdout checkout and the header comment to it, and the
GATE_REPO assertion in tests/test_workflow.py. The workflow and tests are
not hashed, so scripts.sha256 is unchanged.

141 tests OK, manifest verify clean, rulesets check clean.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A9uxVEtbdaw7cznA4jDW61
